            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{%- set p = states('input_number.grid_rate_peak') | float(0) -%}\n{%- set s = states('input_number.grid_rate_shoulder') | float(0) -%}\n{%- set o = states('input_number.grid_rate_off_peak') | float(0) -%}\n{%- set f = states('input_number.grid_rate_solar_feed_in') | float(0) -%}\n{%- set sup = states('input_number.grid_daily_supply_charge') | float(0) -%}\n{%- set t = states('sensor.red_energy_current_tariff') -%}\n{%- set cur = {'Peak': p, 'Shoulder': s, 'Off Peak': o}.get(t, 0) -%}\n{%- set kp = states('sensor.house_grid_import_by_tariff_peak') | float(0) -%}\n{%- set ks = states('sensor.house_grid_import_by_tariff_shoulder') | float(0) -%}\n{%- set ko = states('sensor.house_grid_import_by_tariff_off_peak') | float(0) -%}\n{%- set exp = states('sensor.roof_gosungrow_1498605_sungrow_gosungrow_grid_information_feed_in_energy_today') | float(0) -%}\n{%- set imp_cost = (kp*p + ks*s + ko*o) / 100 -%}\n{%- set exp_cost = exp * f / 100 -%}\n**Method:** When one AC starts while every other AC is off, HA records the whole-house load, waits **7 minutes**, and measures the increase. Later valid samples are smoothed to reduce normal household-load noise.\n\n| Air conditioner | Estimate | Cost per hour* | Since 13 Nov* |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Kitchen AC | {% set v = states('input_number.kitchen_ac_estimated_power') | float(0) %}{% set e = states('sensor.kitchen_ac_energy') | float(0) %}{% if v > 0 %}**{{ v | round(1) }} kW** | ${{ '%.2f' | format(v * cur / 100) }} | {{ e | round(1) }} kWh / ${{ '%.2f' | format(e * cur / 100) }}{% else %}Waiting for an isolated start | – | {{ e | round(1) }} kWh{% endif %} |\n| Lounge Room AC | {% set v = states('input_number.lounge_room_ac_estimated_power') | float(0) %}{% set e = states('sensor.lounge_room_ac_energy') | float(0) %}{% if v > 0 %}**{{ v | round(1) }} kW** | ${{ '%.2f' | format(v * cur / 100) }} | {{ e | round(1) }} kWh / ${{ '%.2f' | format(e * cur / 100) }}{% else %}Waiting for an isolated start | – | {{ e | round(1) }} kWh{% endif %} |\n| Main Bedroom AC | {% set v = states('input_number.main_bedroom_ac_estimated_power') | float(0) %}{% set e = states('sensor.main_bedroom_ac_energy') | float(0) %}{% if v > 0 %}**{{ v | round(1) }} kW** | ${{ '%.2f' | format(v * cur / 100) }} | {{ e | round(1) }} kWh / ${{ '%.2f' | format(e * cur / 100) }}{% else %}Waiting for an isolated start | – | {{ e | round(1) }} kWh{% endif %} |\n| Study AC | {% set v = states('input_number.study_ac_estimated_power') | float(0) %}{% set e = states('sensor.study_ac_energy') | float(0) %}{% if v > 0 %}**{{ v | round(1) }} kW** | ${{ '%.2f' | format(v * cur / 100) }} | {{ e | round(1) }} kWh / ${{ '%.2f' | format(e * cur / 100) }}{% else %}Waiting for an isolated start | – | {{ e | round(1) }} kWh{% endif %} |\n| Bed2 AC | {% set v = states('input_number.bed2_ac_estimated_power') | float(0) %}{% set e = states('sensor.bed2_ac_energy') | float(0) %}{% if v > 0 %}**{{ v | round(1) }} kW** | ${{ '%.2f' | format(v * cur / 100) }} | {{ e | round(1) }} kWh / ${{ '%.2f' | format(e * cur / 100) }}{% else %}Waiting for an isolated start | – | {{ e | round(1) }} kWh{% endif %} |\n\n*Costs use the current tariff rate ({{ t }}, {{ cur }} c/kWh) from Grid Rates. These are directional estimates, not meter-grade readings. Starts are ignored when another AC is already running.*"
            }
